# Changelog
All notable changes to this project are documented in this file.

This project adheres to semantic versioning for academic traceability.

---

## [1.0.0] — 2025-03-03
### Status
Canonical thesis-aligned release

### Added
- Formalized definition of interdependency as reciprocal competence
- Explicit Jungian theoretical foundation
- Operational definition of resonance as a cognitive coherence signal
- Structured articles, definitions, and theoretical boundaries
- Indisciplinary scope declaration
- Explicit non-claims and epistemic limits

### Fixed
- Terminological ambiguities present in pre-release drafts
- Implicit assumptions regarding mythic language
- Boundary confusion between symbolic method and metaphysical assertion

### Notes
This release corresponds to the version submitted for master’s thesis evaluation.
Subsequent changes do not alter the examined framework.

